orbit-tape (0.11.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Key Levels loads faster on long histories (about 40% less replay time
    on 30k 1H bars); the indicator engine skips needless resource scans.
  * Settings panel is wider so rows are no longer cut off at the edge.
  * README and AppStream screenshots show Orbit Tape.
  * CI actions moved to the Node 24 runtime.

